			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName ]は　かいていいせきの
もじが　よめるように　なった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:34:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:21:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName ]は　海底遺跡の
文字が　読めるように　なった！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:33:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・以降、海底遺跡の文字表示切替</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:22:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねんのため　つたえておくが
かいていいせきに　いくには▼
サザナミわんに　でて
ダイビングを　つかうと　よい▼
そして　かいていいせきの　なかで
みつけた　ぶんしょうを▽
じぶんで　かきとめるのだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:22:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:24:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>念のため　伝えておくが
海底遺跡に　行くには▼
サザナミ湾に　でて
ダイビングを　使うと　よい▼
そして　海底遺跡の　なかで
みつけた　文章を▽
自分で　書き留めるのだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:22:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・海底遺跡に行く前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:20:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゲーチスさまの　しょもつに　よると
こだいの　にんげんは　ぶんしょうを▽
はんたいから　よんだ　という</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:21:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ゲーチスさまの　書物に　よると
古代の　人間は　文章を▽
反対から　読んでいた　という</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:20:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第２階層到達前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:20:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しょもつには
たしか　こう　しるされていた……▼
２かいに　あがったなら
もじを　１つ　ずらして　よむ▼
３かいに　あがったなら
もじを　さらに　１つずらすと▼
このばあい　ずらすとは
つぎの　もじに　おきかえることだろう</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:24:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>書物には
たしか　こう　記されていた……▼
２階に　あがったなら
文字を　１つ　ずらして　読む▼
３階に　あがったなら
文字を　さらに　１つずらすと▼
この場合　ずらすとは
次の　文字に　置き換えることだろう</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:25:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第２階層到達</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:38:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たみの　あらそいを　おさめ
ひとつに　まとめたのが▽
おう　という　そんざい　なのだな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:58:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>民の　争いを　治め
一つに　まとめたのが▽
王という　存在　なのだな▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:58:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第３階層到達</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:38:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おうは　みらいを　よみ
いきとし　いけるものと　はなし▽
たみを　まとめていた……▼
これが　しんじつ　だとすれば
まさに　えいゆうでは　ないか！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:39:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>王は　未来を　読み
生きとし　生けるものと　話し▽
民を　まとめていた……▼
これが　真実だとすれば
まさに　英雄では　ないか！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:34:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第４階層到達</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:38:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>けんとうの　つかない　もじもあるが
ぜんごから　さっするに▼
とんでもなく　すばらしい　おうが
いせきで　ねむりに　ついたと▼
もし　おうの　しそんが　いるなら
とくべつな　ちからも▽
つたわっておるのかも　しれんな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:39:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>見当の　つかない　文字もあるが
前後から　察するに▼
とんでもなく　すばらしい　王が
遺跡で　眠りに　ついたと▼
もし　王の　子孫が　いるなら
特別な　力も▽
伝わっておるのかも　しれんな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T13:01:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・第４階層到達＋こだいのおうかん入手
・アイテム入手処理
　No000</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:38:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なにい！？
さらに　すすんだというのか！▼
では　どんな　ぶんしょうが
のこされていたのだ？▼
……　……　……
……　……　……▼
ふむふむ　なるほどな……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T13:02:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>no data</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:25:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・
</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:55:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T11:13:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もっと　たんさく　してくれ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:38:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:36:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>no data</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:36:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:36:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：クリア後
・終了</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:48:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:36:40" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04_sage7_11"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かいていいせきに　ついて
しりたいことは　あつまった▼
さて　こくさいけいさつに
あいに　いくと　しよう▼
われらの　すべてを
はなさねば　ならんからな▼
では　さらばだ！　てきながら
あっぱれな　ポケモントレーナーめ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T13:04:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T13:01:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>no data</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T13:01:10" />
